            "text": "<p>We’ve styled thousands globally, and your perfect vintage fit is next. 💥 Finding <em>that</em> piece can feel risky, but we make it effortless. With over 35,000 happy customers, we’re confident you’ll fall in love with your box. ✨ And if you don’t? We’ll rework it or refund you — guaranteed. No stress, no worries. Your vibe deserves to be unstoppable. 💯</p>",
